      "mergeID": "640f402e73cfc74532ad61cb",
      "mergedPostDetails": "With the new redesign in VCC 2.0, i noticed that projects no longer sort by last opened, now sorting by most recently created/added. I wonder if it would be a good idea to have a way to move the projects listed in the VCC around manually or other sorting methods like the old one, by name, type, etc. I think that this could be a really helpful feature in many ways for many creators who have a lot of projects they work with, from old to new.",
